{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Bamboo Pole is a ",["l","工具","tool"]," used to catch ",["l","鱼","fish"],". One is obtained from ",["l","威利","Willy"]," in the cutscene following the completion of the ",["l","任务#To The Beach","To The Beach"]," quest. Afterwards, it can be purchased from his ",["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"]," for 500g. It cannot have ",["l","鱼饵","bait"]," or ",["l","渔具","tackle"]," attached to it."]]]]]}